# Testing

- **Unit tests:** Vitest in `apps/web/tests/unit/`. Run: `pnpm test` (all packages), or in the web app `pnpm --filter @mrashidi/web test:watch|test:coverage|test:ui`.
- **E2E tests:** Playwright in `apps/web/tests/e2e/`. Run: `pnpm test:e2e`, `pnpm test:e2e:ui`, `pnpm test:e2e:debug`.
- Name a test after the guarantee it proves and test through public interfaces. Run `pnpm gate` before pushing.
